ail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"無量小路 兜之介","creatorId":"vndb:s252","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s252","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s252","name":"三木 眞一郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13050","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36983","characterName":"月島 千夏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36983"},"originalCharacterName":"月島 千夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the protagonist’s childhood friend, and until a year ago, they attended the same school in a small town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When the protagonist moved away, their relationship turned into a long-distance one, though they hadn’t been officially dating before that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In fact, it was the separation that spurred them both to take the initiative, and they finally became a couple."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Perhaps because she grew up in the countryside, she is innocent and demure. She is a girl who is completely devoted to the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She gives her all to everything, and that includes sex as well. Although she’s shy, she’s willing to try all sorts of things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After they were separated, they kept in touch constantly by phone and email, but during summer vacation, she comes to Tokyo all by herself because she wants to see him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36983"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78438b08d865369671949be06ce3242b8afaf131538b8b7394a06c5d883a8784.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/996c27d2d949f10e462828053d78