ource-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's Saeko's friend and tennis partner. She's a married woman. She might look calm, but once she starts venting about her problems, she's anything but calm. She has all sorts of complaints about her husband."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36985"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d08fc59f7051c7edc87b8a9e9a9fb9539a4d1cae1a7eb2f1985933a6fee3892.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b87c93725c39e52200be5c6344e5164457bfcacd4df7e7ab138b06cdb196a2aa.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鳩野 比奈","creatorId":"vndb:s110","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s110","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s110","name":"鳩野比奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13043","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36986","characterName":"西原 つぐみ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36986"},"originalCharacterName":"西原 つぐみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She works at the cafe where Chinatsu works at, they are both the same age. Unlike Chinatsu, Tsugumi has much more experience in sexual matters. She does her best to teach Chinatsu all sorts of things."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36986"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/1401cc3a76284c6858709bc3452fb81c8cdabb8d7d952dfd601ba11a51c74065.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3ac945043940d267a94742f1e4b4245a7b1e47c61c2037bea30d6f9ed558d862.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"なかせ ひな","creatorId":"vndb:s926","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s926","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s926","name":"なかせ ひな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13047","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36987","characterName":"星乃 ツカサ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36987"},"originalCharacterName":"星乃 ツカサ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s a relative of the protagonist and is like a little sister to him. She’s very attached to the protagonist and looks forward to his visits every summer vacation. She’s the cute, clingy “little sister” type"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, when she found out he wouldn’t be coming this year, she ended up coming to his house to see him. She prefers the protagonist, an older, kind, and mature adult ,over boys her own age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At school, she’s a member of the drama club. She has a promising future as a star, that you can see in her eyes. She fully immerses herself in her roles, and appears to drift into another world as she acts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Using her woman’s intuition, she feels a sense of rivalry toward Chinatsu and tries various ways to catch the protagonist’s attention, but her efforts gradually escalate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36987"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37e831ab4521db78a464084003219e7d0b88b6a21570419b65d43328f9fe6781.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b132c4bb639c7e06304249f4b6ffb87ba4389465d9d5f301b1fe4730927a429.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13044","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36988","characterName":"瀬尾 明日香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36988"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬尾 明日香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A former student of the protagonist’s father, a university professor, she is a private tutor who has come at the professor’s request to look after his son while he is away."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They live together for three weeks. She is a slender beauty and holds black belts in martial arts (karate, aikido, etc.)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eager to impress the professor, she resolves to rigorously drill the protagonist during summer vacation to boost his grades."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Consequently, the unannounced visitor (Chinatsu) is nothing but a nuisance to her. Seeking to tear the two apart (?), she goes out of her way to interfere in various ways."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"That said, she isn’t without her feminine side. In fact, she is currently caught up in an unrequited love affair..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36988"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4dc99d9f99b608d810c831d2a175b4fae0eff603d22b2b85d82c43c16b577d31.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/